  "description": "A plugin-based MCP server for React Native runtime debugging, inspection, and automation. Connects to Metro bundler via Chrome DevTools Protocol — no app code changes needed for most features.\n\nWorks with Expo, bare React Native, and any project using Metro + Hermes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `metro-mcp`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install metro-mcp@claude-community` from `steve228uk/metro-mcp`.\n\nA plugin-based MCP server for React Native runtime debugging, inspection, and automation. Connects to Metro bundler via Chrome DevTools Protocol — no app code changes needed for most features.",
